# Task 01 - Docker Installation & Verification

## Objective
Install Docker and verify that Docker Engine is working.

## Important Commands

docker --version
    → Displays Docker CLI version.

docker info
    → Displays Docker Engine information.

docker run hello-world
    → Downloads and runs the hello-world container.

docker images
    → Lists Docker images available locally.

docker ps
    → Lists running containers.

docker ps -a
    → Lists all containers including stopped containers.

## Key Learning

Docker consists of a Docker CLI and Docker Engine.
The CLI communicates with the Docker Engine to create and manage containers.
